{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "mike-study", "elements": [{"id": "426901376a9e4c908442", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 130, "width": 900, "height": 253.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["5f0a8b58144b4634922c"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1053708540, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 949786201, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "f68761d862b54b38b51a", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e70af08d5e834b4a9ae7", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 144, "width": 310.4, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["5f0a8b58144b4634922c"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1780680805, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1892672228, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Susunan pesan ke model (urutan)", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Susunan pesan ke model (urutan)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "060e192798e34aa8b5ae", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 177.0, "width": 623.4, "height": 192.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["5f0a8b58144b4634922c"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2094928723, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1937319456, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1  system prompt  (SYSTEM_PROMPT + daftar dokumen + personalisasi user\n                   + prompt web search / delegasi bila aktif)\n2  [memory turn]   pesan user sintetis paling awal berisi memory.md\n                   — dibungkus sebagai KONTEN TAK TEPERCAYA\n3  riwayat chat    user/assistant lama; reasoning & event lama diperkaya\n                   (attachPriorReasoning, enrichWithPriorEvents)\n4  stempel waktu   tiap pesan user diberi waktu kirim (time_zone user)\n5  pesan user baru + lampiran / workflow / playbook (judul di-spotlight)\n\nDihapus: giliran asisten kosong. Isi stabil per percakapan →\nprefix cache provider efektif (nonce tidak berubah antar giliran).", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "1  system prompt  (SYSTEM_PROMPT + daftar dokumen + personalisasi user\n                   + prompt web search / delegasi bila aktif)\n2  [memory turn]   pesan user sintetis paling awal berisi memory.md\n                   — dibungkus sebagai KONTEN TAK TEPERCAYA\n3  riwayat chat    user/assistant lama; reasoning & event lama diperkaya\n                   (attachPriorReasoning, enrichWithPriorEvents)\n4  stempel waktu   tiap pesan user diberi waktu kirim (time_zone user)\n5  pesan user baru + lampiran / workflow / playbook (judul di-spotlight)\n\nDihapus: giliran asisten kosong. Isi stabil per percakapan →\nprefix cache provider efektif (nonce tidak berubah antar giliran).", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "3679118fba354f168b0e", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1030, "y": 130, "width": 620, "height": 201.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "#ffec99", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["476eb939fa664329a899"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1517252998, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 956956046, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "3949b16c9d1e495ead4d", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "c16e1c252eff476db1e7", "type": "text", "x": 1044, "y": 144, "width": 277.9, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["476eb939fa664329a899"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1884159228, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 330926684, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "SYSTEM_PROMPT — bagian", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "SYSTEM_PROMPT — bagian", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "1c6eec3fdfa34685ab63", "type": "text", "x": 1044, "y": 177.0, "width": 383.4, "height": 140.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["476eb939fa664329a899"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2107615405, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 418531490, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CORE RULES · RESPONSE FORMATTING\nWORKFLOWS · LIBRARY TEMPLATES\nDOCUMENT CITATIONS  (blok <CITATIONS> JSON)\nDOCX GENERATION · DOCUMENT EDITING\nDOCUMENT NAMES IN PROSE  (jangan bocorkan 'doc-N')\nREASONING TRACE SAFETY\nUNTRUSTED CONTENT · WORKFLOW INSTRUCTIONS\nUSER CUSTOM INSTRUCTIONS  (kebijakan tiap sumber)", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "CORE RULES · RESPONSE FORMATTING\nWORKFLOWS · LIBRARY TEMPLATES\nDOCUMENT CITATIONS  (blok <CITATIONS> JSON)\nDOCX GENERATION · DOCUMENT EDITING\nDOCUMENT NAMES IN PROSE  (jangan bocorkan 'doc-N')\nREASONING TRACE SAFETY\nUNTRUSTED CONTENT · WORKFLOW INSTRUCTIONS\nUSER CUSTOM INSTRUCTIONS  (kebijakan tiap sumber)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "ce56ed20a0a743c4b727", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1700, "y": 130, "width": 800, "height": 183.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["490e25ad1c094e3caac2"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 477604125, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2120672555, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "80678d32fdae433b8050", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "fbcdc32fdb4a45a59826", "type": "text", "x": 1714, "y": 144, "width": 244.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["490e25ad1c094e3caac2"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1699981142, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 704235498, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Spotlighting dengan nonce", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Spotlighting dengan nonce", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "82f218cdf0a44d4eb8d4", "type": "text", "x": 1714, "y": 177.0, "width": 672.4, "height": 122.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["490e25ad1c094e3caac2"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1741987295, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1820267168, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "nonce = HMAC(SPOTLIGHT_NONCE_SECRET atau DOWNLOAD_SIGNING_SECRET, conversationId)\nIsi tak tepercaya dibungkus:\n  <untrusted-content nonce=\"N\"> … </untrusted-content nonce=\"N\">\nneutralizeFenceTokens: token pagar palsu di dalam isi dinetralkan\nDibungkus: teks dokumen · halaman web · hasil MCP/konektor · memory ·\nbrief subagent · judul workflow/playbook · nama file\nPrompt menyuruh model memperlakukan isinya sebagai DATA, bukan perintah.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "nonce = HMAC(SPOTLIGHT_NONCE_SECRET atau DOWNLOAD_SIGNING_SECRET, conversationId)\nIsi tak tepercaya dibungkus:\n  <untrusted-content nonce=\"N\"> … </untrusted-content nonce=\"N\">\nneutralizeFenceTokens: token pagar palsu di dalam isi dinetralkan\nDibungkus: teks dokumen · halaman web · hasil MCP/konektor · memory ·\nbrief subagent · judul workflow/playbook · nama file\nPrompt menyuruh model memperlakukan isinya sebagai DATA, bukan perintah.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "b559eeea20534b63a51f", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 520, "width": 900, "height": 183.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cf69e5889c8e4e6f982a"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1903051411, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 527983426, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "f68761d862b54b38b51a", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "1b27c4cb47824b7abacb", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 534, "width": 286.3, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cf69e5889c8e4e6f982a"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1965625915, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1894284011, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "buildDocContext (chat.prepare)", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "buildDocContext (chat.prepare)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "8a1db98107854e088445", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 567.0, "width": 493.2, "height": 122.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cf69e5889c8e4e6f982a"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1217223139, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 203424412, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Sumber document_id: lampiran pesan user + event doc_created / doc_edited\ndari giliran lama. Untuk setiap kontainer (chat, proyek, library, org)\ndicek hak akses → verdict per kontainer → hanya yang lolos masuk.\ndocStore  : doc-N → {id, versi, meta}   (tak pernah dikirim ke klien)\ndocIndex  : label → document_id        (label doc-N hanya internal)\nSetiap tool dokumen memeriksa ULANG akses — kemampuan chat\ntidak pernah memberi hak atas file.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Sumber document_id: lampiran pesan user + event doc_created / doc_edited\ndari giliran lama. Untuk setiap kontainer (chat, proyek, library, org)\ndicek hak akses → verdict per kontainer → hanya yang lolos masuk.\ndocStore  : doc-N → {id, versi, meta}   (tak pernah dikirim ke klien)\ndocIndex  : label → document_id        (label doc-N hanya internal)\nSetiap tool dokumen memeriksa ULANG akses — kemampuan chat\ntidak pernah memberi hak atas file.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "c7b4baf191a6416eae89", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1030, "y": 520, "width": 900, "height": 183.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["8e478385a227480e8943"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 67625834, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 137452962, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "3949b16c9d1e495ead4d", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "d716e62778854ab5bba6", "type": "text", "x": 1044, "y": 534, "width": 119.1, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["8e478385a227480e8943"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1903639041, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 619030498, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Gerbang tool", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Gerbang tool", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "d2417179f6644141aa82", "type": "text", "x": 1044, "y": 567.0, "width": 404.2, "height": 122.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["8e478385a227480e8943"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 954828213, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 279782220, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "advertised  : yang dikirim ke model (skema)\npermitted   : advertised − tool tulis bila !allowDocumentMutation\n               (viewer proyek, thread review = read-only)\nrunTools    : memfilter ULANG saat eksekusi, jadi tool yang\n               tak diiklankan tetap tak bisa dipanggil\nsubagent    : tanpa ask_inputs, tanpa delegate bersarang\ntool konektor tulis: butuh persetujuan user (ask_inputs)", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "advertised  : yang dikirim ke model (skema)\npermitted   : advertised − tool tulis bila !allowDocumentMutation\n               (viewer proyek, thread review = read-only)\nrunTools    : memfilter ULANG saat eksekusi, jadi tool yang\n               tak diiklankan tetap tak bisa dipanggil\nsubagent    : tanpa ask_inputs, tanpa delegate bersarang\ntool konektor tulis: butuh persetujuan user (ask_inputs)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "c199db1f20e843aaaa26", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1960, "y": 520, "width": 800, "height": 183.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["b9150585adf04b62acd0"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 125990531, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1131077297, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "80678d32fdae433b8050", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "65df38ebdef24fb88013", "type": "text", "x": 1974, "y": 534, "width": 89.3, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["b9150585adf04b62acd0"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1302226582, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 453382117, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Alur sitasi", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Alur sitasi", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "0434dafd32644aa598b1", "type": "text", "x": 1974, "y": 567.0, "width": 482.3, "height": 122.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["b9150585adf04b62acd0"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1708971723, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 851256939, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Model menulis [1], [2] di teks + blok <CITATIONS> JSON di akhir:\n  {ref, doc, page, quote}  — doc = label doc-N\nonContentDelta menyembunyikan blok itu dari teks tampil (buffer)\n→ parseCitationsWithDiagnostics → createCitation (doc-N → document_id)\n→ verifyCitations: quote harus ADA di teks sumber hasil ekstraksi\n   (atau di opini CourtListener); yang gagal ditandai tak terverifikasi\n→ frame citations{final}; klien menautkan [n] ke halaman/kutipan", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Model menulis [1], [2] di teks + blok <CITATIONS> JSON di akhir:\n  {ref, doc, page, quote}  — doc = label doc-N\nonContentDelta menyembunyikan blok itu dari teks tampil (buffer)\n→ parseCitationsWithDiagnostics → createCitation (doc-N → document_id)\n→ verifyCitations: quote harus ADA di teks sumber hasil ekstraksi\n   (atau di opini CourtListener); yang gagal ditandai tak terverifikasi\n→ frame citations{final}; klien menautkan [n] ke halaman/kutipan", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "2e674810e2bf4b4d8770", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 720, "width": 900, "height": 148.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0c8599", "backgroundColor": "#96f2d7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["102d4272b4b14bf8a39a"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1397626981, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2110494670, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419173117, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "17550b8b4aa04b8ab8b2", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 734, "width": 232.4, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0c8599", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeS